    ],
    "text": "I, Chandrani Samarakoon, the Commissioner of Local Government of Western Province as per powers entrusted to meunder Clause 66C of Local Government Authorities Elections Ordinance amended by Local Government Authorities Elections(Amendment) Statute No. 22 of 2012 do hereby announce that the recalling meetings of the Local Government Authoritiesof Western Province, names of which mentioned in the Schedule hereunder to be held for the purpose of selecting Mayor,Deputy Mayor, will be convened on the date, time and place correspondingly stated in the aforementioned schedule.",
